<p>Corroon			 DIV	  1.65	  n/a	 1.62</p>
<p>Hambros	  I	    PFT	  45.0	  n/a	(7.7)</p>
<p>Plc			     DIV	   n/a	 2.5-3.0     2.5</p>
<p>THURSDAY, November 14</p>
