<p>NOTES</p>
<p>* The Allied Domecq forecasts exclude a 320 million stg</p>
<p>exceptional loss from the disposal of Carlsberg Tetley.</p>
<p>** The General Accident forecasts are for operating profit.</p>
<p>*** The Commercial Union forecasts are for operating</p>
<p>profit.</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items</p>
<p>unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends</p>
<p>are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
